    27	## Artifact Health Values
    28	
    29	- `valid`: evidence exists, is fresh enough, and can be cited.
    30	- `stale`: evidence exists but violates freshness or drift rules.
    31	- `missing`: evidence path or source is absent.
    32	- `inconclusive`: evidence exists but cannot support acceptance.
    33	- `blocked`: evidence requires human access or external setup.
    34	
    35	## Claim Support Values
    36	
    37	- `supports`: supports the claim being tested.
    38	- `refutes`: refutes the claim being tested.
    39	- `partial`: supports only part of the claim.
    40	- `unrelated`: valid artifact but not relevant to the claim.
    41	- `unknown`: claim relationship has not been assessed.
    42	
    43	## Acceptance Effect Values
    44	
