+```text
+$ find .harnessloop/goals -path '*/rounds/*/decision.md' -type f | wc -l
+14
+$ rg -l --hidden --glob 'decision.md' '^- Feedback: negative' .harnessloop/goals | wc -l
+1
+$ rg -l --hidden --glob 'decision.md' '^- Loop continuation:' .harnessloop/goals | wc -l
+0
+```
